  Daemon not reachable — protection cannot graduate until the intercept daemon answers this worktree.
  daemon: not started (--no-daemon); save-time validation uses the scoped fallback.
  save-time driver: not attached
  next: no intercept daemon is answering for this worktree, so another editor restart will not help; run `anvil start` in a real terminal (not piped) to auto-start the daemon — for headless recovery use `anvil intercept start --foreground` — then re-run `anvil start --verify`.

  Anonymous usage telemetry
  anvil sends at most one anonymous beacon per day so active installs
  and feature adoption can be counted. It only ever contains:
    - schema version
    - anvil version
    - install method
    - platform
    - release channel
    - flag snapshot version
    - feature usage counts
    - anonymous install id (random; derived from nothing)
  Never: paths, repository names, arguments, hostnames, or emails.
  Turn it off any time: `anvil telemetry off`
  (or set ANVIL_TELEMETRY=off or DO_NOT_TRACK=1). Audit it: `anvil telemetry`.
